rect power over it. The sleeping mind hears names more clearly than the waking mind.","tags":["naming","wind"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["notw-char-elodin","notw-char-kvothe"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000014","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-sygaldry","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-magic","title":"Sygaldry and Artificery","body":"Runes make sympathy bindings durable and allow artificers to build lamps, clocks, and protective devices.","tags":["sygaldry","artificery"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["notw-char-kilvin","notw-item-sympathy-lamp"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000051","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-university-ranks","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-magic","title":"University Ranks","body":"Students progress from E'lir to Re'lar and beyond under the masters, with admissions and tuition reassessed each term.","tags":["university","ranks"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["notw-char-kvothe"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000036","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-archives-door","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-magic","title":"The Archives and the Four-Plate Door","body":"The Archives hold a vast but disordered body of knowledge; a sealed stone door with four copper plates remains unexplained.","tags":["archives","mystery"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["loc-archives"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000043","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-edema","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-society","title":"The Edema Ruh","body":"Traveling performers who preserve songs, drama, and stories while facing deep prejudice from settled society.","tags":["edema-ruh","culture"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["notw-char-kvothe","notw-char-arliden"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000007","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-tehlin","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-society","title":"The Tehlin Church","body":"Dominant organized faith centered on Tehlu, with courts capable of prosecuting alleged heresy.","tags":["tehlin","religion"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["notw-char-erlus","notw-char-tehlu"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000023","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-money","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-society","title":"Money and Tuition","body":"Jots, talents, drabs, and Cealdish currency govern survival; University tuition can determine Kvothe's fate each term.","tags":["money","debt"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["notw-char-devi"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000036","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-waystone","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-places","title":"The Waystone Inn","body":"An inn in Newarre where Kote hides from his legend and tells his life to Chronicler.","tags":["frame","newarre"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["loc-waystone-inn","notw-char-kvothe"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lore-tarbean","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","categoryId":"lore-cat-places","title":"Tarbean","body":"A divided coastal city whose Waterside poverty and Hillside wealth shape Kvothe's childhood survival.","tags":["tarbean"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["loc-tarbean-waterside","loc-tarbean-hillside"],"visibleFromEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000018","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"lor